        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 43e8601c-0a01-463a-9295-80c86efc9856).Image",
        "Description": "Enter the building, and eliminate a few key employees for a competitor of Kronstadt. Additionally, allow a blackmailer to engage with Sierra Knox if you could, or alternatively retrieve the documents. However, the blackmailer must be elimenated to ensure no loose ends. It is up to you on how to engage the situation. You must avoid leaving any major traces, via avoiding witnesses and collateral damages.",
